      "en": "Or who is there among you who, if his son asks him for bread, will give him a stone?",
      "ko": "너희 중에 누가 아들이 떡을 달라 하면 돌을 주며",
      "source_text_hash": "4a5119ce76e837b1de6a4175d05dd6c44f0a248102790dfa2ef657656f6cace2",
      "translation_text_hash": "3f4f1c99ef431aa22d29caa6d98c825aff215d3597c68cc433042e8fde504ced",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "너희 중에 누가 아들이 떡을 달라 하면 돌을 주며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "3f4f1c99ef431aa22d29caa6d98c825aff215d3597c68cc433042e8fde504ced"
      ]
    },
    {
