      "en": "If you then, being evil, know how to give good gifts to your children, how much more will your Father who is in heaven give good things to those who ask him!",
      "ko": "너희가 악한 자라도 좋은 것으로 자식에게 줄줄 알거든 하물며 하늘에 계신 너희 아버지께서 구하는 자에게 좋은 것으로 주시지 않겠느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "45eea8eef87c78f3149f1c3f8b3eee0a0f7dc03f95f64ec532450a5b403d5efd",
      "translation_text_hash": "ecd3b76074094cc863411d07665302762b5df1e45ee57b726477aa34481a2349",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
